      35   &  nbonds,     & ! Number of atoms bonded to a given atom
      36   &  set_a,      & ! Set of atoms in first fragment, Used by PM6-DH2
      37   &  set_b,      & ! Set of atoms in second fragment, Used by PM6-DH2
