      71 !
      72 !   SET UP GATHER-SCATTER TYPE ARRAYS FOR USE WITH TWO-ELECTRON
      73 !   INTEGRALS.  JINDEX ARE THE INDICES OF THE J-INTEGRALS FOR ATOM I
