     134 !
     135 !  EXCHANGE TERMS
     136 !
     137 !
     138 !  EXTRACT INTERSECTION OF ATOMS II AND JJ IN THE SPIN DENSITY MATRIX
     139 !
     140             if (ia > ja) then
