     158 !     INSERTED BY PROF. HIRANO
     159 !        To exclude imaginary Wi (here expressed in negative value) and
     160 !        small Wi arising from the imperfect geometry optimization,
     161 !        Wi less than 100 cm-1 (an arbitrary threshold) are neglected
     162 !        in the calculations of vibrational contributions.
     163           if (wi < 1.d-4) cycle
     164 !
 
 FORCHECK PC V13.5.13          THERMO          2021-03-24 10:59:30   page:   944
 thermo.F90  /FF
 
     165           ewj = dexp((-wi*c1))
