     276 !         rrr   = residue three-letter abbreviation (text)
     277 !         mmmm  = residue number (integer)
     278 !         a     = A space or an integer, e.g., 1, 2 or 3, etc.
     279 !         b     = A space or an integer, e.g., 1, 2 or 3, etc.
