     493                  if (in - ix > 0) go to 38
     494 !
     495 !     after the recurrence formula has been applied an appropriate no.
     496 !     of times the next b function is obtained by summing the infinite
     497 !     series.
     498 !
     499 39      if (mod(in, 2) > 0) go to 44
