    3244 !  CALL USMD
    3245         call daread (usmd, msq, ju2mrc + j34)
    3246 !  CALL EPCD
    3247         call daread (eps, msq, jeprec + j34)
    3248 !
    3249 ! FIRST KIND
    3250 !
    3251         yy = yy + trsub(ud3,g1,us,nclose,norbs,norbs)
