       1 subroutine geochk ()
       2 !**********************************************************************
 *
       3 !
 *
       4 !  GEOCHK DOES SEVERAL VERY DIFFERENT THINGS:
       5 !
       6 !   (A) IT CHECKS THE GEOMETRY TO MAKE SURE IT CONFORMS TO THE LEWIS
       7 !       STRUCTURE CONVENTIONS.
       8 !
       9 !   (B) IT IDENTIFIES ALL IONIZED ATOMS. LATER ON, MAKVEC WILL NEED TO
      10 !       KNOW WHICH ATOMS ARE IONIZED.
      11 !
      12 !   (C) IT CALCULATES THE CHARGE ON THE SYSTEM.
      13 !
      14 !   (D) (OPTIONAL) IT RESEQUENCES THE ATOMS SO THAT ALL ATOMS OF EACH
      15 !       RESIDUE ARE CONTIGUOUS.  IF THIS IS DONE, THE JOB CANNOT BE
      16 !       CONTINUED, SO THE NEW GEOMETRY IS PRINTED OUT AND THE RUN
      17 !       STOPPED.
      18 !
      19 !
 *
      20 !**********************************************************************
 *
