      37 !-----------------------------------------------
      38 !--- DEFINED HERE, AND TO BE USED FOR ENPART-PRINT ONLY ---*
      39 !--- END OF DIMENSION DEFINITION ----------------- BY TH --*
      40 !**********************************************************************
 *
      41 !
      42 ! *** ENERGY PARTITIONING WITHIN THE UMNDO SCHEME
      43 !     ROUTINE WRITTEN BY S.OLIVELLA, BARCELONA NOV. 1979.
      44 !     EXTENDED TO AM1 AND PM3 BY JJPS.
