      68 !    one other atom.
      69 !    Pi bonds attached to open-ended pi-bonds are created next.
      70 !    If no open-ended pi-bonds can be created, a delocalized pi-bond is
      71 !    assigned.  Only atoms that pi-bond to exactly two other atoms are
      72 !    involved here. Pi-bonds in five membered rings are NOT allowed, if
      73 !    the ring is attached to one or more six-membered rings.
