     751   !
     752   !   Find the smallest number of atoms that are at the same distance
     753   !   from the center.  This is done by steadily moving out, rmin, from
  the center,
     754   !   and counting the number of atoms in the shell.  The minimum numbe
 r of atoms, k,
     755   !   is at a distance of ymin.
