     865           .or.          l == 8  .and. k == 3 &  !   Octahedron
     866           .or.          l == 12 .and. k == 5 &  !   Icosahedron
     867           .or.          l == 20 .and. k == 3 &  !   Pentagonal dodecahe
 dron
